!README.md

# ffmpeg/ffprobe are build inputs, not source. At 214 MiB each they exceed GitHub's 100 MiB
# per-file limit, and every future swap would add its full weight to clone size permanently.
# Published as a GitHub Release asset instead; see README for where to put them.
bin/*.exe
bin/ffmpeg.exe
bin/ffprobe.exe
